1. Open the official MongoDB Community Server download page: Download MongoDB Community Server .
   Select:
    Version: the latest stable version offered.
    Platform: Windows.
    Package: MSI.
  Click Download.

2. Open the downloaded .msi file.
  Click Next.
  Accept the license agreement.
  Select Complete installation.
  If prompted, select Install MongoD as a Service.
  Keep the default service name and settings.
  Click Next and then Install.
  Allow the installation to finish, then click Finish.

3. Open the official MongoDB Shell download page .
  Select Windows and the MSI installer.
  Download and run the installer.
  Follow the installation wizard.
  Open a new Command Prompt or PowerShell window.

  mongosh --version

4. net start MongoDB
5. mongosh
